==Battleground==
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage throws a frustrating combo of enemies at you: Medu-san and Dark Dober. Dark Dober chips and weakens snipers that counter Medu-san, while Medu-san rips apart the tanks and backliners that counter Dark Dober. Fighting these enemies together would be hellish… so don't! Your goal is to stall for cash, then lure and rush down Dark Dober before Medu-San arrives, as the lengthy spawn delay and Dark Dober's somewhat quick speed leave him rather vulnerable at the start of the stage. Rich Cat is highly recommended.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Talented Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Bahamut does Bahamut things, shredding Dark Dober and fending off support with his Blast attacks. Take care to time him such that his first few attacks aren't weakened by Dark Dober.
*[[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Talented Dark Lazer]]: Weaken Immune and Strong Vs. Dark means Dark Lazer can stand in Dark Dober's range for a while and rack up fantastic dps. Wave attacks chip and disrupt the peons, while great stats let her throw hands with Ragin' Gory.
*[[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]]: Good DPS, bulk and sage slayer let him pile on the damage vs. Dark Dober. Plus, you can call on his Conjure if you're getting overwhelmed.
*[[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]]: While not as overwhelmingly powerful as Bahamut, Idi's Sage Slayer to reduce Dark Dober's weaken and rebound more, along with marginally cheaper cost make her great alongside or instead of Bahamut.
*[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]: Great for the cleanup, as he and some meatshields can basically solo the stage after the mutt's gone.

==Trivia==
*Dictionary Estate's Japanese name, Dikushonarī Jisho, (ディクショナリー地所, "Dictionary Estate"), plays off of how 辞書 (the Japanese word for dictionary) and 地所 (estate) are both read as ''jisho''.
*Dictionary Estate may have been specifically designed for [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] alongside [[Booklet Islands]]. Ultra Kasa Jizo deals massive damage against the many [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies the stage features, such as [[Ragin' Gory]], [[Tarsiriel]], and [[Dark Dober]]. He also has a [[Talents|Talent]] that reduces damage from [[Medu-san]]'s [[Surge Attack|Surges]].

